#: setup.php
msgid "Check this Checkbox if you wish this Graph Export to clear the final directory before populating."
msgstr "Hitamo aka gasanduku niba wifuza ko iri wohereza ry'Igishushanyo hanze risiba ububiko bwa nyuma mbere yo kubushyiramo amakuru."

#: setup.php
msgid "Export Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bwo koherezamo hanze"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory, either on the local system or on the remote system, that will contain the exported data."
msgstr "Ubu ni ububiko bwa dosiye, haba kuri sisitemu y'imbere cyangwa kuri sisitemu ya kure, buzabamo amakuru yoherejwe hanze."

#: setup.php
msgid "Local Scratch Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'imbere"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory that Cacti will temporarily store output prior to sending to the remote site via the transfer method.  The contents of this directory will be deleted after the data is transferred."
msgstr "Ubu ni ububiko bwa dosiye Cacti izabikamo by'agateganyo ibisohoka mbere yo kubyohereza ahantu ha kure binyuze mu buryo bwo kohereza. Ibirimo muri ubu bubiko bwa dosiye bizasibwa nyuma y'uko amakuru yoherejwe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo Kure"

#: setup.php
msgid "Sanitize remote directory"
msgstr "Sukura ububiko buri kure"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to delete any existing files in the FTP remote directory. This option is in use only when using the PHP built-in ftp functions."
msgstr "Hitamo ibi niba wifuza gusiba dosiye zose zisanzwe mu bubiko bwa kure bwa FTP. Aya mahitamo akoreshwa gusa igihe hakoreshejwe imikorere ya ftp isanzwe muri PHP."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Host"
msgstr "Mwakirizi wo Kure"

#: setup.php
msgid "Denotes the host to send Exported Graphs to."
msgstr "Igaragaza Mwakirizi wo kohererezaho Ibishushanyo byoherejwe hanze."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Port"
msgstr "Umuyoboro wo Kure"

#: setup.php
msgid "Communication port to use for the export method if non-standard (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Icyambu cy'itumanaho kigomba gukoreshwa ku buryo bwo kohereza hanze niba atari icya rusange (reka harimo ubusa ku byagenwe mbere)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use passive mode"
msgstr "Koresha uburyo bwa passive"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to connect in passive mode to the FTP server."
msgstr "Hitamo ibi niba wifuza guhuza mu buryo bwa passive kuri seriveri ya FTP."

#: setup.php
msgid "User"
msgstr "Umukoresha"

#: setup.php
msgid "Account to logon on the remote server (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Konti yo kwinjiriraho kuri seriveri ya kure (siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe ibisanzwe)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Ijambobanga"

#: setup.php
msgid "Password for the remote ftp account (leave empty for blank)."
msgstr "Ijambobanga rya konti ya ftp ya kure (hasige ubusa niba nta rihari)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Private Key Path"
msgstr "Inzira y'urufunguzo bwite"

#: setup.php
msgid "For SCP and RSYNC, enter the Private Key path if required."
msgstr "Kuri SCP na RSYNC, andika inzira y'Urufunguzo rw'Ibanga niba bikenewe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Exported Cacti Graph Pages"
msgstr "Amapaji y'Ibishushanyo bya Cacti yoherejwe"

#: setup.php
msgid "(Edit)"
msgstr "(Hindura)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Ibikorwa"

